      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `write_structured_log.py` that writes a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon CloudWatch Logs as the managed logging service because it is a widely used service for log management and provides a robust API for ingesting log data. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the specific client for CloudWatch Logs to write the log event. </thinking>\n",
